    "detailed_description": "<u><strong>Veronica</strong></u><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388720/extras/5bca587b665c1019f930bef9db52509b.poster.avif?t=1708992757\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388720/extras/5bca587b665c1019f930bef9db52509b.webm?t=1708992757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388720/extras/5bca587b665c1019f930bef9db52509b.mp4?t=1708992757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>'Veronica' is a first person psychological horror game based on the events that occur after your movie is interrupted by an amber alert due to sighting reports of a 7 year old girl, Veronica, who went missing 3 years ago. This report catches you by surprise, but not for the reasons you may think.<br><br>Why does it seem like you know more about it than you're sharing? The truth shall reveal itself throughout the game.<br><br><u><strong>Gameplay:</strong></u><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388720/extras/333f7fefe5a49a8b19cd2c5ed9772472.poster.avif?t=1708992757\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388720/extras/333f7fefe5a49a8b19cd2c5ed9772472.webm?t=1708992757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388720/extras/333f7fefe5a49a8b19cd2c5ed9772472.mp4?t=1708992757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u2023 Uncover the mystery of Veronica.<br>\u2023 Navigate through your apartment &amp; interact with the clues Veronica is leaving.<br>\u2023 Jumpscares.<br>\u2023 Psychological horror events.<br>\u2023 Puzzles.<br>\u2023 A story that reveals a dark truth behind the events of the girl who's gone missing.<br><br><strong>WARNING:</strong> The game contains flashes of light that can cause epileptic seizures.",
    "about_the_game": "<u><strong>Veronica</strong></u><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388720/extras/5bca587b665c1019f930bef9db52509b.poster.avif?t=1708992757\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388720/extras/5bca587b665c1019f930bef9db52509b.webm?t=1708992757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388720/extras/5bca587b665c1019f930bef9db52509b.mp4?t=1708992757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>'Veronica' is a first person psychological horror game based on the events that occur after your movie is interrupted by an amber alert due to sighting reports of a 7 year old girl, Veronica, who went missing 3 years ago. This report catches you by surprise, but not for the reasons you may think.<br><br>Why does it seem like you know more about it than you're sharing? The truth shall reveal itself throughout the game.<br><br><u><strong>Gameplay:</strong></u><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388720/extras/333f7fefe5a49a8b19cd2c5ed9772472.poster.avif?t=1708992757\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388720/extras/333f7fefe5a49a8b19cd2c5ed9772472.webm?t=1708992757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388720/extras/333f7fefe5a49a8b19cd2c5ed9772472.mp4?t=1708992757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u2023 Uncover the mystery of Veronica.<br>\u2023 Navigate through your apartment &amp; interact with the clues Veronica is leaving.<br>\u2023 Jumpscares.<br>\u2023 Psychological horror events.<br>\u2023 Puzzles.<br>\u2023 A story that reveals a dark truth behind